======================================================================
CONTRIBUTION FILE - MADE BY AND FOR DEVELOPERS
======================================================================

First of all, thanks for take the time to contribute in our project,
Knight Shell more than a community is a family where we all works together to
make the Shell be better than yesterday, for that we want everyone to be comfortable.

Is important for us to read the CODE OF CONDUCT file, this explain the conduct,
rules and types of content that the community respects.

CODE OF CONDUCT FILE --> https://github.com/NickHubDev/Knight-Shell.git/tree/dev/CODE-OF-CONDUCT

Behind this little talk, is important to understand that the project
is not talked and discuss in forums or things like that, there exists an special
Discord Community and Forum.

-----------------------------------
Discord Community - User Friendly
-----------------------------------

The Discord Community is a visual easy way to understand
the conversations and information, but if you want to
interact in a more technical level, learn the new ideas
and have the exacts pharses of the mainteiners, creators and
developers exists the Forum.

-----------------------------------
Forum - Tecnichal Complicated Way
-----------------------------------

The Forum of Knight Shell is an html interactive
web that let the developers talk more technically and
be more specific than in Discord, is no starter friendly
but one of the best ways to understand every
single desission and information.

By this and more is important you to read the
docs/contributing presentation of this project in the next url:

https://github.com/NickHubDev/Knight-Shell.git/tree/dev/docs/contributing.md

We wait you at the other side! :D
